error[E537]: a union cannot be a type argument written in a call
  --> tests/errors/union_type_argument.tom:10:9
   |
10 |     b = Box[str | None]("a")
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   = help: a union can only come from a value: leave the brackets out and pass a variable of the union type, as in Box(x) with x: str | None, or wrap the union in a class
